# CITATION.cff for logbill — commit at the repo root as CITATION.cff
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: logbill
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
authors:
  - family-names: Sampathi
    given-names: Shiva
repository-code: https://github.com/agentbantu-wq/logbill
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Find what is inflating your observability bill before you pay for it.
  A Go CLI that audits log and metric volume, flags waste (health-check
  spam, Redis PING heartbeats, debug logs in prod, duplicates,
  high-cardinality labels), prices it at Datadog list and flat per-GB
  rates, and emits ready-to-paste drop rules for Datadog, Vector, and the
  OpenTelemetry Collector. Local-only by design.
keywords:
  - observability
  - logging
  - cost-optimization
  - prometheus
  - site-reliability-engineering
